# Kilo Code API Keys — Multi-Machine Template (REDACTED)
# ======================================================
# This file contains API keys for all providers with free-tier credits.
# Fill in the values below, then sync to all machines via:
#   scp ~/.env.kilo.secrets gerardo@192.168.1.169:~/.env.kilo.secrets  (MI)
#   scp ~/.env.kilo.secrets eviwork@192.168.1.180:~/.env.kilo.secrets  (TO)
#   scp ~/.env.kilo.secrets eviwork@192.168.1.160:~/.env.kilo.secrets  (WS)
#
# After copying, run on each machine:
#   source ~/.env.kilo.secrets
#   launchctl setenv NVIDIA_API_KEY "$NVIDIA_API_KEY"  # macOS only
#
# Then fully quit and restart VS Code (Cmd+Q).

